    "scenario": "A museum curator is arranging the order in which seven exhibits—Fossils, Gemstones, Heraldry, Ivories, Jade, Kilims, and Lacquers—will be installed along a single corridor. The exhibits are installed one at a time, in positions 1 through 7 from the corridor's entrance to its end. The installation order must meet the following conditions: Fossils is installed at some point before Jade. Heraldry is installed at some point after Kilims. Ivories is not installed fifth. Gemstones is not installed in a position immediately adjacent to Jade. Lacquers is installed either first or seventh. If Kilims is installed third, then Fossils is installed second. If Jade is installed fifth, then Heraldry is installed sixth.",
